**Model Example (CarePlan):**

```python
# core/care_plans/models/care_plan.py
class CarePlan(BaseModel):
    status = models.ForeignKey(
        "fhir.CodeableConcept",  # ← CodeableConcept: needs use_reference_only: true
        ...
    )
    
    intent = models.ForeignKey(
        "fhir.CodeableConcept",  # ← CodeableConcept: needs use_reference_only: true
        ...
    )
    
    category = models.ManyToManyField(
        "fhir.CodeableConcept",  # ← CodeableConcept: needs use_reference_only: true
        ...
