## Common Mistakes to Avoid

❌ **Not creating configs for related models** - Create configs for ALL models (main + related)
❌ **Setting `mutations: true` on related models** - Related models MUST have `mutations: false`
❌ **Setting `queries: true` on related models** - Related models MUST have `queries: false`
❌ **Missing `mutations: false` in relationship mappings** - Must be false for ALL relationships
❌ **Missing `queries: false` in relationship mappings** - Must be false for ALL relationships
❌ **Missing `services: true`** - Must be true for ALL relationships
❌ **Missing `use_reference_only: true`** - Required for CodeableConcept, Coding, CodeableReference
❌ **Adding `use_reference_only` to non-CodeableConcept fields** - Only for CodeableConcept, Coding, CodeableReference
❌ **Wrong import paths** - Use `core.fhir.data_types.*` for FHIR types, `core.{app}.*` for app models

## Checklist

When creating or modifying `graphql.yaml` files, ensure:

**File Location:**
- [ ] File is in `core/{app}/.codegen/graphql.yaml`
- [ ] Config includes main model
- [ ] Config includes all related/nested models

**Global Settings:**
- [ ] `shareable_inputs_default: false`
- [ ] `shareable_types_default: false`

**Main Model Configuration:**
- [ ] `app` matches directory name
- [ ] `model` matches main model class name
- [ ] `enabled: true`
- [ ] `mutations: true` (main model only)
- [ ] `queries: true` (main model only)
- [ ] All other generate options: `true`
- [ ] `query_prefix` set if namespace is needed (optional)
- [ ] `mutation_prefix` set if namespace is needed (optional)

**Related Models Configuration:**
- [ ] `app` matches directory name
- [ ] `model` matches related model class name
- [ ] `enabled: true`
- [ ] `mutations: false` (related models MUST be false)
- [ ] `queries: false` (related models MUST be false)
- [ ] All other generate options: `true`
- [ ] `query_prefix` set if namespace is needed (optional)
- [ ] `mutation_prefix` set if namespace is needed (optional)

**Field Configuration:**
- [ ] Granular control used for include/exclude/overrides (all, input, type, filter, orders)

**Relationship Mappings:**
- [ ] ALL relationships have `mutations: false`
- [ ] ALL relationships have `queries: false`
- [ ] ALL relationships have `services: true`
- [ ] CodeableConcept fields have `use_reference_only: true`
- [ ] Coding fields have `use_reference_only: true`
- [ ] CodeableReference fields have `use_reference_only: true`
- [ ] Non-CodeableConcept/Coding/CodeableReference fields do NOT have `use_reference_only`
- [ ] All import paths are correct (FHIR vs app-specific)

**Other Settings:**
- [ ] Pagination configured appropriately
- [ ] Filtering configured appropriately
- [ ] Ordering configured appropriately
- [ ] Default order is `"-created_at"`

